                                "text": "\"There are windowless seats / wheelchair spaces at each end of the coach where the (exterior) sliding door slides between the exterior skin and the interior trim. [...] \"My photo is in coach G, the Standard buffet coach, where there's an even longer windowless section.\""
                            }
                        ]
